# Cursor adapter

Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) first.

Use only the guarded npm test entrypoints named there. The
`beforeShellExecution` hook in `.cursor/hooks.json` mechanically blocks raw
runner bypasses. Guard behavior, failures, and recovery are documented in
[`docs/agent-process-guard.md`](../../docs/agent-process-guard.md).
